{"version":1,"content":"<p>長期揭露內地工業污染議題的知名環保志願者張文斌，據報上周二（20 日）在其家鄉新疆烏魯木齊，遭江西省宜春市萬載縣警方「跨省抓捕」，疑涉「敲詐勒索」罪。</p><p>關注團體質疑，張文斌被拘留或與他曾追蹤萬載當地鋰礦產業污染有關；</p><p>萬載縣公安局目前尚未發布警情通報。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:22:19.731929+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T06:36:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:18:15.946255+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T07:18:18.129048+00:00","content_hash":"00ae65d1d1cfcc5a31acfd40feafeaa7df0c0a2e2447dbecb0ad19b2d0756ef5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}